Package: open-mcp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Open MCP client and local MCP servers
 omcp (open-mcp) is a command-line MCP client supporting HTTP and stdio MCP
 transports, named MCP hosts, multiple tool namespaces, and local models.